[6401]={["atomIDs"]={"6401:description:1-82","6401:description:84-97","6401:description:99-165","6401:description:167-221","6401:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Makaba had news for Kaya's aunt after fearing the village attack had taken her. Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat needed to hear that Kaya lived.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the news to Tammra.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} told Tammra that Kaya was alive.",["sourceHash"]="705497005559bb4e8a43d3dc6b4cd89a6c65d99a0d75b554c5aaec6d74931a2f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6402]={["atomIDs"]={"6402:description:1-55","6402:description:60-137","6402:description:142-183","6402:description:185-207","6402:description:209-232","6402:description:234-241","6402:objective:1-55","6402:objective:57-141"},["opening"]="Maxwell sent a rendezvous to Stormwind's gates with a warning of a revelation that could shake the kingdom. Squire Rowe was to notify Windsor when the visitor arrived.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet the Stormwind rendezvous through Squire Rowe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the rendezvous assignment at Stormwind's gates.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0fc2bf24e7697c5a9c5ca9fbd07f477fd0ebc72c25e0d079f4c5f6d297c522c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6403]={["aftermath"]="Fordragon identified the medallion as the instrument of his captivity and credited Windsor's sacrifice with breaking it. Onyxia's threat remained, while the shattered key required renewed power.",["atomIDs"]={"6403:description:1-40","6403:description:42-77","6403:description:79-115","6403:description:120-246","6403:description:251-312","6403:description:314-372","6403:description:374-393","6403:description:395-419","6403:description:424-471","6403:description:476-489","6403:objective:1-42","6403:objective:44-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6403:completion:1-39","6403:completion:44-83","6403:completion:85-117","6403:completion:122-217","6403:completion:222-274","6403:completion:276-344","6403:completion:346-407"},["opening"]="Windsor identified Prestor as Onyxia and described Fordragon as ensnared by her influence. He intended to end that hold by proceeding through Stormwind, a public action that required protection.",["pending"]="{actor} would follow and protect Reginald Windsor through Stormwind.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment to accompany and protect Reginald Windsor through Stormwind.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0ff48e143baa674d7be92ba7df943c8803a3c7fee2bbe7dc935d8a077f45d9b4",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6421]={["aftermath"]="Mor'rogal found traces of Earthen magic and inferred that the digging had uncovered an Earthen.",["atomIDs"]={"6421:description:1-38","6421:description:40-79","6421:description:84-141","6421:description:143-214","6421:description:216-312","6421:description:315-368","6421:description:373-446","6421:objective:1-135"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6421:completion:7-10","6421:completion:12-74","6421:completion:76-128","6421:completion:133-199","6421:completion:201-251","6421:completion:253-308","6421:completion:313-340","6421:completion:345-416"},["opening"]="Kobolds were mining Resonite with unusual urgency beneath Boulderslide. Mor'rogal wanted both an exploration of the cave's depths and samples to study.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to explore the cave and gather ten crystals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the crystals after exploring the cave.",["sourceHash"]="869c6c3f3c44aed61f477f4f96bffcadbf4c74dc96da369c68fac90c27f56f43",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6441]={["atomIDs"]={"6441:description:1-5","6441:description:7-118","6441:description:120-229","6441:description:234-364","6441:description:366-397","6441:description:399-429","6441:description:434-510","6441:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Pixel paused at Splintertree on the way to Ratchet, where satyr horns were in demand. The creatures of Night Run, Satyrnaar and Xavian could supply the sixteen horns she sought for trade.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather sixteen Satyr Horns for Pixel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered sixteen Satyr Horns to Pixel.",["sourceHash"]="58b1d175ca29f7dc9d7430bed1e3d6624dcc5e44ffde6853cfeb07a720f83d71",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6442]={["atomIDs"]={"6442:description:1-47","6442:description:52-150","6442:description:153-179","6442:description:184-247","6442:description:250-343","6442:description:348-383","6442:description:385-418","6442:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="Marukai described Zoram as a city lost beneath the sea. The naga's return remained unexplained, but he treated their presence as a threat to the claimed coast and demanded twenty heads.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover twenty Wrathtail Heads for Marukai.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Wrathtail Heads to Marukai.",["sourceHash"]="af26e40807e7f82b9674e86e6eb68d09fcbb1e0df8a21e04467d9834398b12da",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6461]={["atomIDs"]={"6461:description:1-118","6461:description:123-174","6461:description:176-269","6461:description:274-365","6461:description:367-472","6461:objective:1-92"},["opening"]="Malaka'jin's hunters had attracted thieves to their stored food. Xen'Zilla blamed mountain spiders for nighttime raids on the camp's catches.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the creepers and venomspitters.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Xen'Zilla's spider assignment.",["sourceHash"]="64ff189eedee6eed4af1742d7f8e3960413c2d7a9e7266af1d8a1259e6c632d4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6462]={["atomIDs"]={"6462:description:1-145","6462:description:148-167","6462:description:172-259","6462:description:262-320","6462:description:323-367","6462:description:372-404","6462:description:407-505","6462:objective:1-57"},["opening"]="Mitsuwa's kin had been killed by Thistlefur furbolgs before reaching Zoram'gar. Their sacred charms remained in chests inside Thistlefur Hold, and she wanted those belongings restored.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover eight Troll Charms for Mitsuwa.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Troll Charms to Mitsuwa.",["sourceHash"]="cab399a968df07047bd8a7746b051ba320578000cdcd129e1e908015f4f16891",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6481]={["atomIDs"]={"6481:description:1-49","6481:description:51-148","6481:description:153-249","6481:description:251-345","6481:description:350-392","6481:description:394-406","6481:objective:1-83","6481:objective:85-149"},["opening"]="Mor'rogal identified a sleeping Earthen inside the Resonite cask. He enchanted the gathered crystals to weaken Goggeroc when the container was broken open.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to open the cask and confront Goggeroc.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the task and returned the enchanted crystal.",["sourceHash"]="b949916913766b7fd83469598a5423bf075bd97d07273105b01abc46444e9a40",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6482]={["atomIDs"]={"6482:description:6-17","6482:description:27-44","6482:description:47-62","6482:description:65-130","6482:description:133-157","6482:description:162-245","6482:description:254-267","6482:objective:1-64"},["opening"]="Ruul said the furbolgs had mistaken him for a bear and captured him. Starvation was weakening him, and he asked for escape and word sent to his sister Yama at Splintertree.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Ruul and inform Yama Snowhoof.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Ruul's escort assignment and spoke with Yama Snowhoof.",["sourceHash"]="27725451a6279dc37b39d4bd3945792914ac37e57bd6d3c130e31604f54e8fad",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6501]={["aftermath"]="Haleh recognized the fragment's connection to Onyxia. The search had reached someone of dragon blood without yet completing the restored key.",["atomIDs"]={"6501:description:1-62","6501:description:67-147","6501:description:149-225","6501:description:227-270","6501:description:275-318","6501:description:320-342","6501:description:344-366","6501:description:368-444","6501:description:446-461","6501:objective:1-105","6501:objective:107-177"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6501:completion:1-71","6501:completion:73-88"},["opening"]="Only a fragment remained of the shattered medallion. Bolvar knew another dragon might restore it, possibly hidden in humanoid form, but offered no certain place to begin the search.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find a dragon capable of restoring the Fragment of the Dragon's Eye.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search assignment with Haleh.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="24fb4a8055599c063873131b37e132e967137e5f7f5e6d467d2ed76472b5c2b2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6502]={["aftermath"]="Haleh confirmed that the amulet could overcome the wards at Onyxia's lair in Dustwallow, and offered the Blue Flight's good wishes.",["atomIDs"]={"6502:description:1-65","6502:description:67-122","6502:description:124-148","6502:description:153-251","6502:description:253-267","6502:description:269-347","6502:description:349-378","6502:description:383-501","6502:objective:1-81","6502:objective:83-174"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6502:completion:1-52","6502:completion:54-105","6502:completion:107-181","6502:completion:186-221"},["opening"]="Haleh identified the fragment as an enchanted dragon scale whose broken state denied access to the lair. Drakkisath's blood could restore it into a key through Onyxia's wards.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the dragon champion's blood for Haleh.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion to Haleh.",["sourceHash"]="9204f140d9c0da73014856d7d334c6c2b92350dbf00a8bb2f199b4f800a713ac",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6503]={["atomIDs"]={"6503:description:1-133","6503:description:136-193","6503:description:198-293","6503:description:296-343","6503:objective:1-78"},["opening"]="Kuray'bin had reports of Silverwing outrunners moving secretly near Splintertree's territory. He feared they were studying the defenses and directed a search through the forest to the south.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to undertake the assignment against nine Ashenvale Outrunners.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against nine Ashenvale Outrunners and returned to Kuray'bin.",["sourceHash"]="ac20f04b6f3da296ceb411ff6c37799fcdf77eae8246d4213c85b47e8f6f8aaa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6504]={["aftermath"]="With the manual restored, Gurda expected to return to work. The missing instructions had been the obstacle between the new shredder and its operator.",["atomIDs"]={"6504:description:1-131","6504:description:133-249","6504:description:251-315","6504:description:320-378","6504:description:380-433","6504:description:435-460","6504:objective:1-111","6504:objective:113-170"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6504:completion:1-32","6504:completion:34-74","6504:completion:76-86"},["opening"]="Wind scattered Gurda's shredder manual on the road from Ratchet. Left with only its cover, she could not operate the machine for her Warsong lumber-camp duty until the twelve pages were reassembled.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the manual's twelve pages and assemble its three chapters.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the three assembled chapters of the Shredder Operating Manual to Gurda.",["sourceHash"]="f6f26f2ffd1454afe4d0c612b58f7747b7ef8eaccd35e50a3e3282b6a02f77ab",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6521]={["aftermath"]="Varimathras believed the death had checked the Scourge's advance, while admitting that its full influence within the Downs remained unknown.",["atomIDs"]={"6521:description:1-43","6521:description:45-126","6521:description:131-312","6521:description:314-375","6521:description:380-408","6521:description:410-445","6521:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6521:completion:1-5","6521:completion:7-20","6521:completion:25-112","6521:completion:114-192","6521:completion:197-326"},["opening"]="Varimathras saw the plagued quilboar as evidence of a bargain with the Scourge. Malcin's position outside Razorfen Downs gave him an ambassador whose mission could be stopped.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to defeat Malcin and bring his head to Varimathras.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Ambassador Malcin's head to Varimathras.",["sourceHash"]="984acd926e2d92c7d29eb97504e169169e2d650b67d805d6e1303b4dd639f585",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6522]={["aftermath"]="Varimathras recognized the insignia and the ambassador's former service to Lordaeron. He saw the letter as a reason to act against a Scourge foothold in Kalimdor.",["atomIDs"]={"6522:description:1-8","6522:description:13-58","6522:description:60-139","6522:description:141-174","6522:description:176-262","6522:description:267-307","6522:description:309-387","6522:description:389-444","6522:description:449-461","6522:description:464-480","6522:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6522:completion:1-44","6522:completion:46-105","6522:completion:107-118","6522:completion:123-177","6522:completion:179-333","6522:completion:335-342","6522:completion:347-431"},["opening"]="Malcin's scroll offered power and conquest in return for freedom to act in the Barrens. The letter placed its writer outside Razorfen Downs and was bound for Varimathras.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the small scroll to Varimathras.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Malcin's scroll in the Undercity.",["sourceHash"]="7d2ec6f73bbed21505461460b2fe900cf7e08fc73ddcaa6050836f28b3e85894",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6523]={["aftermath"]="Makaba learned that Kaya was alive and acknowledged the rescue.",["atomIDs"]={"6523:description:1-26","6523:description:28-85","6523:description:87-119","6523:description:121-146","6523:description:151-219","6523:objective:1-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6523:completion:1-14","6523:completion:16-56"},["opening"]="Kaya wanted to leave before her captors discovered her freedom. From Camp Aparaje she knew her way, but her father still needed news of her safety.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Kaya and report to Makaba.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Kaya's escort and reached her father.",["sourceHash"]="ef79ce4458c0be7fe85647dc94bfbfd32af5930ab2dbb98118e3361c1a72fec2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6541]={["atomIDs"]={"6541:description:1-46","6541:description:48-185","6541:description:190-275","6541:description:277-348","6541:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Thork sought recruits for the Horde's growing Ashenvale fronts. Kadrak at the northern watchtower would supply orders for the campaign.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to report to Kadrak for Thork.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Kadrak at the northern tower.",["sourceHash"]="d23b0ef035e4d94ce906a7e1c8eea0463a620228a6c72148933c04f744b1185c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6542]={["atomIDs"]={"6542:description:1-46","6542:description:48-185","6542:description:190-275","6542:description:277-348","6542:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Darn directed prospective defenders toward Kadrak's watchtower. The new coastal outpost created another front requiring help.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to answer Darn's referral to Kadrak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Kadrak in the northern Barrens.",["sourceHash"]="a313e81f2f2d5496970cd5ed192ce7f3989e907cbde26f8ab071364413f8dcb7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6543]={["aftermath"]="Kadrak accepted the reports as the information needed to plan the campaign's next move.",["atomIDs"]={"6543:description:1-149","6543:description:154-279","6543:description:281-383","6543:description:385-428","6543:description:433-504","6543:objective:1-27","6543:objective:30-113","6543:objective:115-204"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6543:completion:1-50","6543:completion:52-127","6543:completion:129-158"},["opening"]="Kadrak's scouts needed orders and he needed their findings. The route linked the coastal outpost, Splintertree and the eastern road toward Azshara.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to exchange the reports with all three scouts.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the three updates to Kadrak.",["sourceHash"]="b22b275cab7cddcdae3575c62b039c7c5983b1605fa77fdbbe9378e2410c02c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6544]={["atomIDs"]={"6544:description:1-4","6544:description:12-21","6544:description:26-97","6544:description:100-141","6544:description:144-217","6544:description:220-247","6544:description:252-301","6544:description:304-404","6544:description:409-424","6544:description:427-442","6544:objective:1-126"},["opening"]="Torek's raiders prepared to strike Silverwing Outpost and its leader Duriel Moonfire. Scouts warned of heavy defenses, and a successful assault would need to be reported to Ertog at Splintertree.",["pending"]="{actor} would accompany Torek's assault and report to Ertog.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Torek's assault escort assignment and reported to Ertog Ragetusk.",["sourceHash"]="4fe3c0bcaa5208a0e8b05a1182643d818417da38f8832331b6f2a123b1bc3c22",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6548]={["aftermath"]="Makaba remained unable to forget what the clan had done to his home.",["atomIDs"]={"6548:description:1-62","6548:description:64-117","6548:description:122-170","6548:description:172-215","6548:objective:1-131"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6548:completion:1-18","6548:completion:20-86"},["opening"]="Makaba had barely survived the Grimtotem attack that destroyed his village. His request for retaliation came from the loss of most of its people.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the nearby Grimtotem raiders.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Makaba's assignment against the raiders.",["sourceHash"]="33a9b8d2daf6c186593e41d08e8d0598b909ec0c87e4ae42ca81979c3b3df35b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6561]={["aftermath"]="Bashana welcomed the end of a cultist the Argent Dawn had long lost track of and credited it with sparing further victims.",["atomIDs"]={"6561:description:1-21","6561:description:23-42","6561:description:47-93","6561:description:95-221","6561:description:226-279","6561:description:284-364","6561:description:366-435","6561:description:440-510","6561:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6561:completion:1-48","6561:completion:53-102","6561:completion:107-180","6561:completion:185-207","6561:completion:209-295","6561:completion:300-336","6561:completion:338-467","6561:completion:469-482"},["opening"]="Thaelrid described an old temple corrupted from below and occupied by cultists and naga. Kelris led sacrifices to Aku'Mai; his head was to reach Bashana as proof of his end.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Kelris's head to Bashana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Twilight Lord Kelris's head in Thunder Bluff.",["sourceHash"]="c42ce887262db50f385e57616ec37bb26ade08f2b48ec197bdb5712251dd18f2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6562]={["aftermath"]="Je'neu welcomed Tsunaman's referral and prepared to explain the matter.",["atomIDs"]={"6562:description:1-33","6562:description:35-78","6562:description:80-144","6562:description:146-234","6562:description:236-281","6562:description:283-297","6562:description:299-364","6562:objective:1-37"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6562:completion:1-18","6562:completion:20-29","6562:completion:31-62"},["opening"]="Tsunaman directed aid toward Je'neu at Zoram'gar on Ashenvale's western shore. Reaching the outpost meant crossing a forest where some forces would be hostile to the traveler.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Je'neu at Zoram'gar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",["sourceHash"]="a32cfece7cc0523e4785e97a75b14df2134b5178e0f4da8fb1954d63d59953a7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6563]={["aftermath"]="Je'neu sensed water spirits clinging to the crystals and welcomed their removal from the naga's control.",["atomIDs"]={"6563:description:1-109","6563:description:111-175","6563:description:177-255","6563:description:257-368","6563:description:373-393","6563:description:395-472","6563:objective:1-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6563:completion:1-14","6563:completion:16-49","6563:completion:51-63","6563:completion:68-100","6563:completion:102-136","6563:completion:138-185","6563:completion:187-241"},["opening"]="Je'neu feared the power of crystals the naga were harvesting in Blackfathom's entrance tunnels. Until their purpose was understood, he wanted the sapphires taken out of their hands.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather twenty sapphires for Je'neu.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Sapphires of Aku'Mai to Je'neu.",["sourceHash"]="fad301e79d90e4c2609289fc15e09918fb5db22e621b508afffb1841282872e0",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6564]={["aftermath"]="Je'neu identified Lorgus Jett as the name behind the trouble.",["atomIDs"]={"6564:description:1-58","6564:description:63-121","6564:description:123-239","6564:description:244-313","6564:description:315-422","6564:description:424-455","6564:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6564:completion:1-27","6564:completion:29-74","6564:completion:79-116","6564:completion:118-129"},["opening"]="A damp note described crystals used to strengthen aquamancer summonings. Its writer hoped to appease Aku'Mai and restore an age ruled by the Old Gods.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the note to Je'neu.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Damp Note to Je'neu.",["sourceHash"]="6bdff20251c1e49e6d0b8e4597eb7f558135b95c6db0bb7536527070d9cb9ea0",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
