[6607]={["aftermath"]="Nat admired the catch and prepared to demonstrate how to set several lines.",["atomIDs"]={"6607:description:1-38","6607:description:40-89","6607:description:94-161","6607:description:166-275","6607:description:277-391","6607:description:396-474","6607:description:476-489","6607:objective:1-48","6607:objective:53-124","6607:objective:129-188","6607:objective:193-240","6607:objective:245-314","6607:objective:319-371"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6607:completion:1-24","6607:completion:29-82"},["opening"]="Nat believed mastery required patience more than decades of fishing. Four rare catches from distant waters would demonstrate the determination he wanted to teach.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to catch Nat's four rare fish.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the mahi mahi, striker, ahi, and blue sailfin to Nat.",["sourceHash"]="c5ad1665f648cc802195e8078584032c9be5f365f702da50ede0a5d9d9e0376e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6608]={["aftermath"]="Nat recognized Lumak's referral and offered to discuss fishing.",["atomIDs"]={"6608:description:1-30","6608:description:32-44","6608:description:46-74","6608:description:76-95","6608:description:97-112","6608:description:114-139","6608:description:144-223","6608:description:225-245","6608:description:247-253","6608:objective:1-96","6608:objective:98-250"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6608:completion:1-41","6608:completion:46-53","6608:completion:55-87"},["opening"]="Lumak had reached the end of what he could teach. His recommendation pointed to his human friend Nat, fishing among the islands south of Theramore.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek Nat in Dustwallow.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Nat Pagle south of Theramore.",["sourceHash"]="09927c50e502a9b104e5e1f5fbe714d3de16862f78c60b966417f2e2fdea1082",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6609]={["aftermath"]="Nat welcomed another visitor to the island.",["atomIDs"]={"6609:description:1-47","6609:description:49-78","6609:description:80-97","6609:description:99-131","6609:description:136-173","6609:description:175-210","6609:description:215-230","6609:description:232-240","6609:description:242-298","6609:description:300-333","6609:description:335-377","6609:description:379-388","6609:objective:1-53","6609:objective:55-119","6609:objective:121-150"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6609:completion:1-49","6609:completion:51-61"},["opening"]="Grimnur declared his own fishing knowledge exhausted. He sent the pupil across to Kalimdor, where his old friend Nat could be found south of Theramore.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Nat on the islands near Theramore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Nat Pagle's island.",["sourceHash"]="9c0d3aa8fe34203fe7fa02929590a2e3d472df0474adeac8d4e75445a233b3ba",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6610]={["aftermath"]="Dirge began preparing the dish and urged the pupil to watch and learn.",["atomIDs"]={"6610:description:1-26","6610:description:28-49","6610:description:51-99","6610:description:101-161","6610:description:166-216","6610:description:218-245","6610:description:247-405","6610:description:407-412","6610:description:417-435","6610:objective:1-54","6610:objective:59-72","6610:objective:74-158","6610:objective:163-191","6610:objective:193-231","6610:objective:236-262","6610:objective:264-286","6610:objective:291-334"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6610:completion:1-35","6610:completion:37-52","6610:completion:57-101"},["opening"]="Dirge had devised a clamlette but lacked the supplies to make it. Eggs, clam meat, and cheese would secure a demonstration of his exotic cooking.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather twelve giant eggs, ten clam meats, and twenty portions of cheese.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Dirge the requested eggs, clam meat, and Alterac Swiss.",["sourceHash"]="502238f0db433927d4c5fa85612ac0772aae8ac182fc07492c78886a6302497d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
