[6612]={["aftermath"]="Dirge interrupted his mouthful of leather to receive the visitor.",["atomIDs"]={"6612:description:1-60","6612:description:62-101","6612:description:106-134","6612:description:136-188","6612:description:193-264","6612:description:266-308","6612:description:310-331","6612:objective:1-110"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6612:completion:1-26","6612:completion:31-39","6612:completion:44-64","6612:completion:69-73","6612:completion:75-167"},["opening"]="Daryl recognized a capable cook beyond the reach of his own teaching. His recommendation led to Dirge, a goblin he considered among Kalimdor's best.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to seek Dirge in Gadgetzan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Dirge in Tanaris.",["sourceHash"]="4dbf050de99da37fc3da6ed4972d62793d7bbff62ec39344cd8ff34927bc4177",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6621]={["aftermath"]="Karang interpreted the defeated chief and recovered totem as a warning from the Horde. His expectation of quieter relations remained his judgment about the tribe's future.",["atomIDs"]={"6621:description:1-75","6621:description:78-158","6621:description:161-208","6621:description:213-292","6621:description:295-414","6621:description:417-446","6621:description:451-473","6621:description:476-507","6621:objective:1-51","6621:objective:54-96","6621:objective:99-174"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6621:completion:1-14","6621:completion:16-111","6621:completion:116-151","6621:completion:156-229"},["opening"]="Karang proposed a show of force against the Foulweald southeast of Astranaar. A defended banner on their totem mound was intended to draw out Chief Murgut, whose totem Karang demanded.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defend Karang's Banner and recover Murgut's Totem.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the banner-defense assignment and delivered Murgut's Totem to Karang.",["sourceHash"]="8404bd8963ef171b426d6d913a608f874b174a66c7e1517d54f980287c8350f4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6622]={["aftermath"]="Gregory welcomed the new doctor into the Horde's trauma service.",["atomIDs"]={"6622:description:1-17","6622:description:19-99","6622:description:101-186","6622:description:191-208","6622:description:210-256","6622:description:258-300","6622:description:302-338","6622:description:340-383","6622:description:385-438","6622:description:443-475","6622:description:480-497","6622:objective:1-63","6622:objective:65-131","6622:objective:136-164","6622:objective:166-244","6622:objective:246-381"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6622:completion:1-35"},["opening"]="Gregory's examination tested the order of care under pressure. Fifteen soldiers had to survive, with the critically wounded treated before those whose injuries allowed more time.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to save fifteen patients before six died.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} passed Gregory's examination by saving fifteen patients within the required limit.",["sourceHash"]="919e76b360728d9a8236cd3aab26401ee093b456a0e52ce298d1096a3dc18b32",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6623]={["aftermath"]="Gregory prepared to begin at once and called for the medical clothing to be put on.",["atomIDs"]={"6623:description:1-21","6623:description:23-56","6623:description:61-95","6623:description:97-213","6623:description:215-258","6623:description:260-349","6623:description:351-383","6623:objective:1-122"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6623:completion:1-10","6623:completion:12-55"},["opening"]="Arnok relayed a personal request from Gregory at Hammerfall. He regarded the chance to study under the chief physician as an exceptional opportunity.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Gregory in Hammerfall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Doctor Gregory Victor.",["sourceHash"]="68d39c9f0447bd284c755e3985d9fd4b487a5f5300ff0154b0a4139096ef0733",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6624]={["aftermath"]="Gustaf welcomed the doctor into the Alliance's trauma service.",["atomIDs"]={"6624:description:1-17","6624:description:19-99","6624:description:101-189","6624:description:194-211","6624:description:213-259","6624:description:261-303","6624:description:305-341","6624:description:343-386","6624:description:388-441","6624:description:446-463","6624:objective:1-63","6624:objective:65-131","6624:objective:136-164","6624:objective:166-244","6624:objective:246-381"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6624:completion:1-38"},["opening"]="Gustaf's examination demanded quick judgment among patients with different injuries. The critically hurt would die first; saving fifteen before six deaths would demonstrate the required skill.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to prioritize the patients and save fifteen in time.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Gustaf's examination with the required fifteen patients saved.",["sourceHash"]="61af57e23e0ad660297538bc24c418b6531711ca72b0b096a0589d9cfd8b0fe8",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6625]={["aftermath"]="Gustaf welcomed the arrival and prepared to start immediately.",["atomIDs"]={"6625:description:1-21","6625:description:23-50","6625:description:55-89","6625:description:91-204","6625:description:206-249","6625:description:251-343","6625:description:345-385","6625:objective:1-126"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6625:completion:1-10","6625:completion:12-55"},["opening"]="Nissa passed on Gustaf's request for a visit to Theramore. The chief physician's personal invitation offered a chance to join his medical service.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Gustaf in Theramore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen.",["sourceHash"]="9c523daf2fed056efddd4377550908137621071b44e39132c03cad8c301c6ce5",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6626]={["aftermath"]="Myriam thanked the hunter and continued her investigation of the diplomat and quilboar, pointing out greater dangers within the Downs.",["atomIDs"]={"6626:description:1-36","6626:description:38-47","6626:description:49-70","6626:description:72-136","6626:description:138-186","6626:description:191-273","6626:description:275-343","6626:description:348-399","6626:description:401-416","6626:description:418-445","6626:objective:1-150"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6626:completion:1-14","6626:completion:16-67","6626:completion:72-147","6626:completion:149-274","6626:completion:276-342"},["opening"]="Myriam suspected the diplomat near Razorfen Downs of serving the Scourge. For now, she wanted help against the growing ranks seeking power around him while she continued her study.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to defeat eight each of the battleguards, thornweavers, and cultists.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the requested defeats to Myriam.",["sourceHash"]="f5c0ffb3d1476a2beba358885e2fd165a79e5c6ece25ec4ad6ae4ac4c276789e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6627]={["atomIDs"]={"6627:description:1-67","6627:description:69-82","6627:description:87-137","6627:description:139-181","6627:objective:1-75","6627:objective:77-134"},["opening"]="Braug had received the book and was ready to examine its reader. The question allowed as much time as needed for an answer.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to answer Braug's question.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} answered correctly and spoke with Braug.",["sourceHash"]="f055a4717b4d8ee7bafc050b233ae88f118728d43257ef8e2ee053db9a1c2741",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6628]={["atomIDs"]={"6628:description:1-34","6628:description:36-110","6628:description:115-151","6628:description:153-264","6628:objective:1-76","6628:objective:78-129"},["opening"]="Parqual brought his part of the lore trial to its question. He offered time to consider the answer rather than demanding speed.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to answer Parqual's question.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} answered correctly and returned to Parqual.",["sourceHash"]="ad3b9f170f64121469d19c1e529f393dbd6b2ce591ba998afac97a0b7c109995",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6629]={["atomIDs"]={"6629:description:1-45","6629:description:47-140","6629:description:142-196","6629:description:201-274","6629:description:276-316","6629:objective:1-118"},["opening"]="Makaba named Grundig as the leader of the attack on his village. The target and his closest brutes waited farther along the western path.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront Grundig and his personal band.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment and reported to Makaba.",["sourceHash"]="a16ab2d42736536bc1e4fc7d278e43877fc947c33a82b3086d461894669cd268",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6641]={["aftermath"]="The Warsong Runner took relief in Vorsha no longer roaming freely. The response concerned the hydra's threat, without claiming an end to every naga attack.",["atomIDs"]={"6641:description:1-20","6641:description:22-62","6641:description:67-166","6641:description:171-189","6641:description:191-259","6641:description:264-374","6641:description:376-436","6641:description:441-498","6641:objective:1-47","6641:objective:49-132","6641:objective:137-255"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6641:completion:1-56","6641:completion:58-120","6641:completion:125-148"},["opening"]="Muglash blamed Vorsha the Lasher for repeated attacks on Zoram'gar. He hoped extinguishing the naga's island brazier would lure out the hydra, but needed protection through the provocation and its response.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to protect Muglash, extinguish the brazier and report the outcome to the Warsong Runner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Muglash's protection-and-brazier assignment and reported Vorsha's defeat to the Warsong Runner.",["sourceHash"]="1706d99d86499f77ac57fb53ac0b16ac27fb87e999d9debcc5facd34957c8bff",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6661]={["aftermath"]="Monty explained that his brother needed fresh, living rats for his kabobs.",["atomIDs"]={"6661:description:1-19","6661:description:21-28","6661:description:30-55","6661:description:57-134","6661:description:139-153","6661:description:155-248","6661:description:250-292","6661:description:297-359","6661:description:361-378","6661:description:383-391","6661:objective:1-56","6661:objective:58-85","6661:objective:87-141"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6661:completion:1-28","6661:completion:30-96","6661:completion:98-138"},["opening"]="Monty needed five live rats from the Deeprun Tram. His flute could draw the vermin along, making it possible to bring them back without killing them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to lead five rats back to Monty and return his flute.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Monty five live rats and returned the flute.",["sourceHash"]="18332a51b2e84f9009351e641eb2c67cbc1d2b3656be755dea49a8f8c5119349",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6662]={["aftermath"]="Nipsy spoke of Monty's change since Gnomeregan and his imagined life at sea, while acknowledging the continuing supply of fresh rats.",["atomIDs"]={"6662:description:1-75","6662:description:77-143","6662:description:145-158","6662:description:163-196","6662:description:198-207","6662:description:209-261","6662:description:263-343","6662:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6662:completion:1-11","6662:completion:13-72","6662:completion:74-155","6662:completion:160-173","6662:completion:178-233"},["opening"]="Monty packed the rats for his brother's food business at the other end of the tram. The carton needed to reach Nipsy in Stormwind before its contents spoiled.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the carton to Nipsy.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Carton of Mystery Meat at the Stormwind depot.",["sourceHash"]="efa3643568bf1a71b86da4cde4d071d0811550e734fd74c86c0225c4198742d0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6681]={["aftermath"]="Fahrad welcomed the arrival and directed the prospective disciple to the guards for the next work.",["atomIDs"]={"6681:description:8-60","6681:description:62-83","6681:description:85-140","6681:description:145-353","6681:description:358-462","6681:description:467-474","6681:description:479-484","6681:objective:1-97","6681:objective:102-143","6681:objective:145-156"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6681:completion:1-28","6681:completion:33-86","6681:completion:91-137","6681:completion:139-219","6681:completion:224-253","6681:completion:255-280"},["opening"]="Fahrad's letter offered entry into Ravenholdt's circle after a test of cunning. The attached seal had to reach the manor hidden in Hillsbrad's hills.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find the manor and take the seal to Fahrad.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Seal of Ravenholdt to Fahrad.",["sourceHash"]="7dd14b5c7995679ac45a8227e0fddaaff61ada2d4d971af42223caf5ab224ec2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6721]={["aftermath"]="Dazalar agreed that the time had come to proceed.",["atomIDs"]={"6721:description:1-20","6721:description:22-113","6721:description:118-150","6721:description:152-207","6721:objective:1-31"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6721:completion:1-20"},["opening"]="Regnus sent the hunter to Dazalar in Dolanaar. The pupil's skill appeared sufficient to begin learning how to earn an animal companion.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to seek Dazalar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Dazalar in Dolanaar.",["sourceHash"]="a21166632ee7bda2c737ca249e138eabe2b741824802fd00af02bfc2a92bcde6",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6722]={["aftermath"]="Dazalar accepted the pupil as ready.",["atomIDs"]={"6722:description:1-20","6722:description:22-113","6722:description:118-150","6722:description:152-207","6722:objective:1-31"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6722:completion:1-20"},["opening"]="Einris recommended Dazalar for the next step in a hunter's training. A meeting in Dolanaar would begin the lessons of working with a beast.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet Dazalar in Dolanaar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Dazalar.",["sourceHash"]="85713461d562ad050f2a8e9802f01cf4856c1c5bc5b1ddc69bf912b14a6f9d3a",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6761]={["atomIDs"]={"6761:description:1-89","6761:description:92-128","6761:description:133-155","6761:description:157-167","6761:description:169-175","6761:description:178-288","6761:description:291-323","6761:description:326-419","6761:description:424-483","6761:objective:1-70"},["opening"]="Fandral passed Moonglade's appeal to Mathrengyl while defending his own role in Teldrassil's future. His sharp dismissal revealed tension behind the administrative referral.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Mathrengyl about Moonglade's call.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mathrengyl Bearwalker.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f6927bc99adc30627810e52f0f7d93f3d982bf25b7cd852ecab0549c3204beea",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6762]={["atomIDs"]={"6762:description:1-145","6762:description:147-179","6762:description:182-246","6762:description:251-347","6762:description:350-402","6762:description:404-446","6762:objective:1-66","6762:objective:69-165"},["bridge"]="Fandral's sharp referral had reached Mathrengyl. He directed help to Rabine in Nighthaven while cautioning about the tensions between Darnassus and Moonglade.",["bridgeFrom"]=6761,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Mathrengyl sent help to Rabine, Remulos's majordomo in Nighthaven, for exploration far west of Tanaris. His advice to tread carefully concerned politics between Darnassus and Moonglade as well as distance.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Rabine Saturna in Moonglade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="a371bcc7d5c4dfc3d49b5d8f5048fb7ea8bc30f550fe019c59982bf91da7a01e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6804]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis confirmed the cure and linked the Waterlords' strength to their demanded purity.",["atomIDs"]={"6804:description:1-134","6804:description:137-191","6804:description:196-210","6804:description:213-258","6804:description:261-353","6804:description:356-419","6804:description:424-490","6804:objective:1-73","6804:objective:76-158"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6804:completion:1-23","6804:completion:25-98","6804:completion:100-199"},["opening"]="Waterlord scouts had been infected in the Plaguelands. Hydraxis's vial could fight the poison but would drive the recovering elementals into a dangerous internal conflict.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to cure the elementals and return twelve bracers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the discordant bracers and vial to Hydraxis.",["sourceHash"]="5471a112a3daa490cf62ac0542c95873d39f84b677c4f4671c73dfa03a7dd3ec",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6805]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis accepted the demonstration as grounds for more demanding work.",["atomIDs"]={"6805:description:1-79","6805:description:82-154","6805:description:159-288","6805:description:291-422","6805:description:427-503","6805:objective:1-89"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6805:completion:1-47","6805:completion:50-143"},["opening"]="Hydraxis's war reached the earth and air servants in Silithus. He did not know why they guarded objects of power, but sought to frustrate them in the Crystal Vale.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront fifteen stormers and fifteen rumblers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the elemental assignment.",["sourceHash"]="0c6aa9669ffecf500295d3c2ffece35d2d20cc1b3f621ebee0d80f6082781052",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6821]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis credited cunning as well as strength in the venture into Blackrock Spire.",["atomIDs"]={"6821:description:1-110","6821:description:113-160","6821:description:162-213","6821:description:218-239","6821:description:244-336","6821:description:339-416","6821:description:419-466","6821:objective:1-59"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6821:completion:1-32","6821:completion:35-134","6821:completion:139-189"},["opening"]="The Waterlord's next test sought more than lesser foes. The orcs held a powerful fire servant in the Spire, and the captive's eye would show whether the new ally could meet that challenge.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the Emberseer's eye.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the eye to Hydraxis.",["sourceHash"]="cf91242edc980966e1acad3554ddafe912a0113dc8921027ab5634b7d44ea8b1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6822]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis recognized an exceptional feat and held open the possibility of a true allegiance.",["atomIDs"]={"6822:description:1-47","6822:description:50-63","6822:description:68-133","6822:description:136-227","6822:description:232-257","6822:description:260-332","6822:description:337-394","6822:description:397-464","6822:objective:1-114"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6822:completion:1-60","6822:completion:63-122","6822:completion:127-185","6822:completion:190-278"},["opening"]="Hydraxis directed the trial deeper into the fire servants' stronghold. Four different denizens of the Core would measure whether the alliance could advance beyond earlier tests.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to fulfill the four-part Core assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported its completion to Hydraxis.",["sourceHash"]="6e245382727d568ad79f8f7031ba02b19fc626fa8696659d20bb86ecac61e8fe",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6823]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis acknowledged respect earned despite doubts about a mortal ally's fragility.",["atomIDs"]={"6823:description:1-123","6823:description:126-235","6823:description:240-327","6823:objective:1-93"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6823:completion:1-82","6823:completion:85-198","6823:completion:201-255"},["opening"]="A lasting allegiance required a longer campaign against air, earth and fire. Hydraxis invited continued service until the Waterlords granted honored standing.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to earn honored Waterlord standing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned with the required standing.",["sourceHash"]="0bb54de7c2a8735e4d4270a82f8b0bf5f869c45c390da6e10f08de5fdd9117d7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6824]={["aftermath"]="Hydraxis confirmed the captains' defeat and expected the news to spread among the Waterlords.",["atomIDs"]={"6824:description:1-142","6824:description:147-211","6824:description:213-244","6824:description:249-343","6824:description:346-380","6824:description:385-506","6824:objective:1-89"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6824:completion:1-19","6824:completion:22-52","6824:completion:55-140","6824:completion:145-246","6824:completion:249-286","6824:completion:291-314","6824:completion:317-346"},["opening"]="The Waterlords judged a useful agent worth risking for a major blow. Hydraxis demanded the hands of four captains whose defeat would weaken the fire campaign.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the four captains' hands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the hands to Hydraxis.",["sourceHash"]="2bde5b15b6d91cf64dc9049f1c9793edeae64b177ba3a59e6968bc88921e5ab4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6844]={["aftermath"]="Umber prepared to crack its covering while admitting he preferred books to the horrors reported from Silithus.",["atomIDs"]={"6844:description:1-96","6844:description:99-168","6844:description:171-273","6844:description:278-327","6844:description:330-372","6844:description:375-415","6844:description:418-469","6844:description:472-504","6844:objective:1-120"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6844:completion:1-24","6844:completion:26-48","6844:completion:50-85","6844:completion:87-118","6844:completion:123-156","6844:completion:158-306","6844:completion:308-436"},["opening"]="The object might preserve a window into Silithus's past. Layo deferred local work to send it to the Circle's archivist, whose skill might save what the chitin concealed.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the encrusted object to Umber.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it in Nighthaven.",["sourceHash"]="2fa5174fac173e685febab260f842857ee4d66944fa286d8285cfe89eedabbfd",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
