[6961]={["aftermath"]="The greeting mixed wishes for a happy feast with Smokywood's promises of treats.",["atomIDs"]={"6961:description:1-36","6961:description:39-81","6961:description:84-184","6961:description:187-237","6961:description:242-318","6961:description:321-361","6961:description:364-442","6961:objective:1-98"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6961:completion:1-12","6961:completion:15-98","6961:completion:100-237","6961:completion:242-369","6961:completion:372-378"},["opening"]="Kaymard promoted the holiday celebrations at Smokywood's vendor area. Greatfather Winter waited nearby to receive visitors and their hopes for seasonal treats.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to greet Greatfather Winter in Orgrimmar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Greatfather Winter beside the vendors.",["sourceHash"]="f95823d900b483e1d1525458afb9bdfb02a0d828852d0f907c1bb690bcb0752c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6962]={["aftermath"]="The helper's effort earned thanks and a holiday gift.",["atomIDs"]={"6962:description:1-71","6962:description:76-214","6962:description:217-308","6962:description:311-380","6962:objective:1-85"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6962:completion:1-61","6962:completion:64-97","6962:completion:102-129","6962:completion:131-155"},["opening"]="A long day of greeting visitors had left Great-father Winter wanting a treat himself. Gingerbread cookies and cold milk were his request.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring five cookies and a serving of milk.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the cookies and milk to Great-father Winter.",["sourceHash"]="b19a402b36ed360f33a63e17abf812a2128774128fbccad011dc012229793b6a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6963]={["aftermath"]="The apparent snowman identified himself as Sacks. A strange creature had attacked him while he searched for the missing package.",["atomIDs"]={"6963:description:1-9","6963:description:11-155","6963:description:160-339","6963:description:342-452","6963:description:457-498","6963:objective:1-111"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6963:completion:1-24","6963:completion:27-52","6963:completion:57-177","6963:completion:179-304","6963:completion:309-327"},["opening"]="Smokywood had lost both a shipment and the agent sent to investigate it. Kaymard placed the last report in the snowy Alterac Mountains.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to locate the missing investigator in Alterac.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the investigator in the snowy mountains.",["sourceHash"]="903e20210abaea809cfe9561e606e34db7a310d5b32a7fa927d04491f74e1377",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6964]={["aftermath"]="Sagorne acknowledged the loss of older meaning while accepting celebration, urging remembrance of the feast's origins alongside it.",["atomIDs"]={"6964:description:1-26","6964:description:28-38","6964:description:43-123","6964:description:126-287","6964:description:292-391","6964:description:394-483","6964:objective:1-100"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6964:completion:1-34","6964:completion:37-104","6964:completion:107-246","6964:completion:251-316","6964:completion:319-386","6964:completion:389-492"},["opening"]="Furmund objected to the feast's reduction to presents and sweets. He pointed toward Sagorne for the older account of a sleeping land renewed beneath winter's snow.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to ask Sagorne about the feast's origins.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Sagorne in the Valley of Wisdom.",["sourceHash"]="a406472eca81af8a90577249c3d2ae6f598c49a144d0f2e4016602b1bb9898b7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6981]={["aftermath"]="Falla had never seen anything like the shard.",["atomIDs"]={"6981:description:1-104","6981:description:106-231","6981:description:236-320","6981:objective:1-81","6981:objective:86-129"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6981:completion:7-45"},["opening"]="Smoke appeared to swirl beneath the green shard's solid surface. Its strange nature called for inquiry in Ratchet, then delivery according to the guidance found there.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek an explanation and follow the resulting directions.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the glowing shard to Falla Sagewind.",["sourceHash"]="0f8821d237afe2c106f7f9665464f6a7c3d49c73ec8ea1e5977a205f84cb1cea",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6982]={["aftermath"]="The quartermaster accepted the supplies despite their condition after storage underground.",["atomIDs"]={"6982:description:1-52","6982:description:55-154","6982:description:157-162","6982:description:164-241","6982:description:246-303","6982:description:306-416","6982:description:421-434","6982:description:437-494","6982:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6982:completion:1-17","6982:completion:19-32","6982:completion:34-150","6982:completion:155-168","6982:completion:170-232"},["opening"]="Coldtooth's Horde stockpile offered the Stormpike quartermaster two advantages: fresh resources for Dun Baldar and fewer supplies for the enemy. His dislike of their provisions mattered less than the needs of the war.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring ten Coldtooth supply loads back to Dun Baldar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the captured Coldtooth stores to the Stormpikes.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="22c4884636821683ea23f5b4afb3a4af8d066b274e71724b100e7e17d2ad23e1",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6983]={["aftermath"]="Kaymard promised to send help for Sacks and find a way to unfreeze him, hoping he could return by the feast.",["atomIDs"]={"6983:description:1-103","6983:description:106-127","6983:description:130-186","6983:description:191-240","6983:description:243-337","6983:description:340-462","6983:objective:1-72","6983:objective:75-207"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6983:completion:1-13","6983:completion:16-69","6983:completion:74-86","6983:completion:88-163","6983:completion:166-273","6983:completion:276-335"},["opening"]="Sacks named the Greench as the thief and the source of his snowy predicament. The treats had to return to Orgrimmar along with word that the investigator needed help.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the stolen shipment for Kaymard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the stolen treats to Kaymard in Orgrimmar.",["sourceHash"]="6df132ea956047de0663d64dbb2a34f0f4481b5557ac089062344174a51b9111",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
